                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.29317/2610.29317v1/spatialbrain_self_evolution_overview.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Self-evolution from earlier trajectories.(a) Initial reasoning leaves the reference frame unresolved. (b) Completed earlier trajectories are abstracted and consolidated between task blocks. (c) Accumulated experience guides memory access and skill selection for the same target. The trajectories and outcomes are illustrative.",
